## NAME
vtium-gallery - show PNG pictures as thumbnails in a terminal that supports kitty graphics

## SYNOPSIS
@SYNOPSIS@

## DESCRIPTION
@DESCRIPTION@

A build of vtium with image support installs the program as `vtium-gallery`. The program is a bash script, and needs only bash and the usual base tools.

## OPTIONS
@OPTIONS@

## EXIT STATUS
= 0
vtium-gallery showed the pictures, or printed its usage.

= 1
vtium-gallery found no PNG picture, or the terminal did not answer that it supports kitty graphics.

= 2
The command line is wrong, or a file or directory it names does not exist.

## SEE ALSO
vtium(8)
